&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height:30.8pt;min-height:30.8pt;"&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:10.5pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;font-size:9pt;"&gt; 2021年６月&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:10.5pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;font-size:9pt;"&gt;「雪印メグミルクグループ 人権方針」&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:9pt;"&gt;制定&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:2pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:10pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height:30.8pt;min-height:30.8pt;"&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:10.5pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;font-size:9pt;"&gt; 2021年10月&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:10.5pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;font-size:9pt;"&gt; 経済人コー円卓会議日本委員会（ＣＲＴ）&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:10.5pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;font-size:9pt;"&gt; 支援によるワークショップ開催&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:2pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:10.5pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;font-size:9pt;"&gt;サステナビリティ担当役員、関係部署参加のもと、社内および&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:9pt;"&gt;サプライチェーン上における「潜在的な人権リスク」を抽出&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height:30.8pt;min-height:30.8pt;"&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:10.5pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;font-size:9pt;"&gt; 2022年１月&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:10.5pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;font-size:9pt;"&gt; ＣＲＴによる社内講演「ビジネスと人権の&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:10.5pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;font-size:9pt;"&gt; 理解」&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:2pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:10.5pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;font-size:9pt;"&gt;全役員、全従業員が視聴&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height:36.5pt;min-height:36.5pt;"&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:10.5pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;font-size:9pt;"&gt; 2022年３月&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:10.5pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;font-size:9pt;"&gt; ＣＲＴの分析により「優先的に取り組む&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:10.5pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;font-size:9pt;"&gt; 人権リスク」を特定&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
