&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height:31pt;min-height:31pt;"&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#a9a9a9;border-left-color:#a9a9a9;border-right-color:#a9a9a9;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;再評価を行なった土地の期末に&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:4.5pt;padding-right:4.5pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;おける時価と再評価後の帳簿価額との差額&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#a9a9a9;border-left-color:#a9a9a9;border-right-color:#a9a9a9;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblR" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:right;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;"&gt;294&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#a9a9a9;border-left-color:#a9a9a9;border-right-color:#a9a9a9;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;"&gt;百万円&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#a9a9a9;border-left-color:#a9a9a9;border-right-color:#a9a9a9;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblR" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:right;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;293&lt;/p&gt;
